# Build Journey bounds table — seated 20260730.020927 (v27 · slot 11 · explicit_bounds).
# Named BEFORE any build; the builds inherit these and never invent their own.
# All powers of two, per the season's own arithmetic.
discovery_max_peers 256
# why: the bounded table's whole population — matches dep_crawl's proven MAXN
discovery_descriptor_max_bytes 512
# why: one signed self-description (key · transport hints · freshness · lineage)
discovery_gossip_fanout 8
# why: peers told per exchange — wide enough to spread, narrow enough to audit
discovery_staleness_max_seconds 4096
# why: ~68 min on one clock; older descriptors age out rather than mislead
discovery_introduce_hops_max 2
# why: star introduces ship — one hop up, one down; deeper wants a word
myc_fact_max_bytes 256
# why: one signed multisig fact — signatures plus a purpose line, nothing riding
star_name_max_bytes 32
# why: a %term-compatible reserved name — lowercase and hyphens, generously
ship_sol_proof_max_bytes 1024
# why: the on-chain name-proof reference and its signature, liveness-checked
myc_fold_snapshot_max_bytes 4096
# why: one FoldState freeze for a journey-scale log · door 9 · power of two
# seated 20260730.084042 lean · metal 20260730 door 9 create
refusal_storm_min_cases 5
# why: one adversarial bite per primitive · storm incomplete under five
# seated 20260730.090221 lean · door 10 charter · create inherits
myc_perf_baseline_min_rows 5
# why: fold · fold_persist · ship_sol · build_bounds · refusal_storm — Build myc surface
# seated 20260730.101101 lean · door 11 charter · create inherits · S0 no tuning
